                <div class="progress mb-3" style="height: 8px; border-radius: 4px;">
                    <div id="tcl-modal-progress-bar" class="progress-bar bg-success" role="progressbar" style="width: 0%;"></div>
                </div>
                <div id="tcl-modal-container" class="list-group list-group-flush border-top">
                    <div class="text-center py-4 text-muted small">
                        <div class="spinner-border spinner-border-sm me-2" role="status"></div> 載入中...
